{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca297c0b8f759f12fd955a07c2461da25418bdf2985a1d7a3cc1712c1b80cff7", "ja": "未来、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装はどうだ。サイズ、合ってるか？", "zh": "未来，你辛苦了。\n新服装怎么样？尺寸还合身吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "27dd694ef671f5f49244686f92b9dfd70e3f5c7987d1a3b2232fb7b9d48b642b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん♪\nはい、試着してみたけどピッタリです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪\n嗯，我试穿起来很合身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "1e950771b80bfea2856a059836fc24141810fbf5f9a720158fe2e01e7af86782", "ja": "この衣装、すっごくカワイイですよね♪\nお花が咲いてるみたいで……♪", "zh": "这套服装超可爱的♪\n就好像绽放的花朵一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "6f924f8918b22fc4d4490e7c7f5ce8888949e98e8c2496873d61d29091b76150", "ja": "こんな衣装を作ってくれちゃうなんて、\n{$P$}さん、何者なんですか！？", "zh": "居然可以做出这么棒的服装，\n{$P$}先生，你究竟是何方神圣！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2410b7f1f6d46606b7a6c65f7996e16983c84a24e27b16bb44ebb5628eb2f3d9", "ja": "何者……未来のプロデューサーかな？　まあ、\n実際に衣装を作ってくれたのは青羽さんだけどな！", "zh": "何方神圣……算是你的制作人吧？\n不过，缝制服装的人实际上是青羽小姐就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "5d2d198367bdd07ea0db1455b4cbaff2e4e3fbadfdef72e46c1f8d0e4bc48d2a", "ja": "なるほど～！\nだから私にピッタリなんですね♪　でへへ～。", "zh": "原来是这样～！\n所以才会这么适合我啊♪嘿嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7f0f7d34f53ce450682df458ba1c316c24357abd3d5e263d60071998cb14f278", "ja": "うん、見た感じ、特に直すところはなさそうだな。\nそれじゃ、青羽さんに報告して……。", "zh": "嗯，看起来是没有特别需要修改的部分。\n那我去向青羽小姐回报……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ac495f7b8d6883fc1f5708bd9e306e550233ae5f2d7428bd5ad7d80d47cd0f4", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、\nちょっと待ってください！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n稍等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "883f19050df10f3fb21af40b19e0817657efb635930f692e623a665d016c2157", "ja": "衣装のことで、大事な確認しようと思ってたの、\nすっかり忘れてました！", "zh": "关于服装，我有件重要的事情想确认。\n刚才不小心就忘得一干二净了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4d4fe05580fe577bdbd7e4919624b1dddde1a94fa6a075de6fc09e8283612c6e", "ja": "大事なのに、すっかり忘れてたのか……。\nそれで、確認って？", "zh": "明明是重要的事，却忘得一干二净了吗……\n你想确认什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "65115eee8afb1b780da94a85b31ea2e9c163dd93c87e89ba3c7ddf1d8bfe6ca5", "ja": "えっと、この衣装、たくさん動いても平気ですか？\n私、思いっきり動いちゃうから心配で！", "zh": "呃，穿着这套服装，就算动作量很大也没关系吗？\n我做动作都特别卖力，所以很担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "7798dabf5ee9220ea045a7c0b0ea7b854784c5e4a8837a6a29cf404cc56cd491", "ja": "もしジャンプしたり走ったりして、スカートが\n破れちゃったりしたら、すごく悲しいですよ～……。", "zh": "要是跑跑跳跳害裙子破掉了，\n我会很难过啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "25f070be053b71b3e338405b5a0ca55940584ebd34109ba6e1ab7f86f83bee4d", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事か。\nステージ衣装なんだから、もちろん大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是要问这个啊。\n这套毕竟是舞台服装，当然没问题啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e6f9dace6593cd671f2cca6cf00e9893b9b566a318e00400c160ad7eb808604", "ja": "ホントですか！？　じゃあ、ちょっと動いてみますね！\nいぇーい♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n那我去稍微活动看看喔！耶──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a1d73b0c905a6edf06d6c82fe2934465e226fdf3f1ac1bf7c1649ae463041d51", "ja": "うわっ！　おい、未来……！", "zh": "哇！喂，未来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "460f88dfcbc9428d69a2f2815a678539e71aeb74ae5b57e3d97cccc57bb3143d", "ja": "わぁ、本当だ♪　全然大丈夫ですね！\nこれなら、いっぱいダンスできちゃいそう♪", "zh": "哇，真的耶♪完全没问题！\n这样的话我就可以跳很多舞了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_1016", "source_sha256": "3947f85de9fe43191269923de37294fd5917da7197c8d25c1eebf73254544b9f", "ja": "ストップ！", "zh": "Stop！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
