{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "dda4580c7ad69393be35cecaafbf93eb461e767d7f38b8dd439dc48c353a58f2", "ja": "あれ？\n{$P$}さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}先生，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a9ad1269b74be5c63a66303abd0d1ef86fe8e6d52017b0f37245da334923be94", "ja": "「どうかしたんですか？」じゃなくて……。\n見えるから、気をつけてくれないか。", "zh": "还问「怎么了吗」……\n会看见啦，麻烦你注意一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_2003_014mir", "source_sha256": "479be8703e2a4e408e9c6bc80ec684a7eb1eeda3961f6a84cb74c53f3cc1ea50", "ja": "見える？　……見えるって、何がですか？", "zh": "看见？……你是说看见什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0064_2004_p", "source_sha256": "4b5c6b0c4c208ad2fcd72e195a48b6763e07ccbf40e8c40b88ad2fee6bad4591", "ja": "いや、わからないならいい……いや、よくないな。\nつまり、衣装の下に着るものが、まだ届いてないだろ？", "zh": "没事，你听不懂就算了……不对，不能就这样算了。\n我是说，穿在这套服装底下的配件还没送来对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
